you've married your brother's woman.

289
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:27,480
You and Fang Mulan

290
00:19:28,550 --> 00:19:30,270
are both morally corrupt.

291
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,800
You'll live in disgrace
for the rest of your lives.

292
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,080
Everything I've done

293
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:38,400
is for the Murong family!

294
00:19:42,030 --> 00:19:44,030
What right do you have to condemn us?

295
00:19:45,550 --> 00:19:46,640
From Murong Feng,

296
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:48,200
to my brother, to Ren Susu,

297
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:49,530
to me, and even to Le'an—

298
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,510
all you've ever wanted is for everyone

299
00:19:52,510 --> 00:19:53,710
to dance to your tune.

300
00:19:54,590 --> 00:19:56,070
Again and again,

301
00:19:56,310 --> 00:19:58,200
you've trampled on everyone's will

302
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:00,330
and tried to control everyone's life.

303
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:01,590
Now

304
00:20:02,830 --> 00:20:05,230
you've become someone everyone despises,

305
00:20:05,790 --> 00:20:07,790
and this is entirely your own doing.

306
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:09,680
That child

307
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:13,150
is the Murong family's
own flesh and blood.

308
00:20:14,350 --> 00:20:15,510
Bringing him home

309
00:20:16,230 --> 00:20:17,440
is only right.

310
00:20:19,270 --> 00:20:20,640
I will never allow

311
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:22,410
that morally corrupt woman

312
00:20:22,590 --> 00:20:23,830
to be his mother.

313
00:20:23,830 --> 00:20:25,310
I'll raise him myself.

314
00:20:25,310 --> 00:20:27,310
He'll become the heir
to the Murong family!

315
00:20:27,310 --> 00:20:28,200
In your dreams!

316
00:20:31,350 --> 00:20:32,960
What do the words

317
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:34,920
"flesh and blood"

318
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:36,750
even mean to you?

319
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:38,370
Are we just puppets?

320
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:41,680
How do you know...

321
00:20:44,270 --> 00:20:47,350
that child isn't your brother's son?

322
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,680
How pathetic.

323
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:21,440
You've ruined too many people's lives.

324
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,120
But I will absolutely not

325
00:21:25,590 --> 00:21:26,920
let your paranoia

326
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:29,750
ruin my life again.

327
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,550
This is my final warning—

328
00:21:36,070 --> 00:21:37,870
stay away from my wife and child.

329
00:21:38,350 --> 00:21:39,160
Otherwise,

330
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,880
I will not let you off.

331
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:48,440
Leave then!

332
00:21:49,830 --> 00:21:51,090
Every single one of you

333
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,860
thinks only about leaving me—

334
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:54,240
abandoning me!

335
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,720
Then don't ever come back!

336
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:58,960
Don't ever come back!

337
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:01,830
Don't come back...

338
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,750
Don't come back...

339
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:48,700
[Murong Residence]

340
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:17,400
Brother,

341
00:23:17,590 --> 00:23:19,270
may I come into your study?

342
00:23:22,790 --> 00:23:23,440
Boze,

343
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:24,840
you can enter my study

344
00:23:25,200 --> 00:23:26,310
whenever you want.

345
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:51,030
Brother...

346
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:56,270
I'm so tired.

347
00:24:58,350 --> 00:24:59,590
I'm really so tired.

348
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:07,480
I don't know what to do anymore.

349
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:13,820
I really have done everything
I possibly could.

350
00:25:17,030 --> 00:25:18,360
And yet, this family...

351
00:25:21,070 --> 00:25:23,130
this family has fallen apart anyway.

352
00:25:34,740 --> 00:25:35,670
[RDX Explosive Purchase Contract]

353
00:26:19,350 --> 00:26:23,410
Brother had been secretly investigating
Father Li and the Zhang family.

354
00:26:33,590 --> 00:26:35,720
Put me through to the aviation school.

355
00:26:38,050 --> 00:26:38,730
[File]

356
00:26:43,030 --> 00:26:45,160
I need to speak with Vice Principal Ye.

357
00:26:54,590 --> 00:26:57,920
This man stole some Red Pills
from the train station warehouse.

358
00:26:57,920 --> 00:26:59,550
According to the men from his unit,

359
00:26:59,550 --> 00:27:01,070
he'd been using them secretly
for a long time,

360
00:27:01,070 --> 00:27:02,600
and nothing ever happened.

361
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:03,880
But this time, he heard a new batch

362
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:05,540
had arrived at the station...

363
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:07,520
After taking the new Red Pills,

364
00:27:07,590 --> 00:27:08,880
he ended up like this.

365
00:27:15,310 --> 00:27:16,510
-Marshal.
-Marshal, you can't go in.

366
00:27:16,510 --> 00:27:17,040
Marshal.

367
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,600
Marshal, you can't go in.

368
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:21,790
Let him in.

369
00:27:27,550 --> 00:27:29,000
Mr. Li, today...

370
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:35,800
This isn't just some drug, is it?

371
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:40,080
There's something else mixed into it, huh?

372
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:44,400
You've seen the power
behind our chamber of commerce.

373
00:27:45,510 --> 00:27:46,370
What do you say?

374
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:48,440
Work with us.

375
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:54,970
What exactly are you plotting?

376
00:27:55,830 --> 00:27:57,760
What's with this strange disease?

377
00:27:58,270 --> 00:27:59,270
How is it treated?

378
00:28:07,310 --> 00:28:09,110
They're just some side effects.

379
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:11,590
They chose to sink into depravity.

380
00:28:11,590 --> 00:28:14,250
If it weren't Red Pills,
it'd be some other drug.

381
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:17,070
I simply give them a cheaper alternative,

382
00:28:17,070 --> 00:28:18,920
and they're deeply grateful for it.

383
00:28:18,920 --> 00:28:19,720
Besides,

384
00:28:20,750 --> 00:28:22,210
this stuff relieves pain.

385
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:23,880
In times like these,

386
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:25,440
medicine is so scarce.

387
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,440
When poor people fall ill,

388
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:29,110
all they can do is endure it.

389
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:31,790
This stuff makes them forget the pain.

390
00:28:32,270 --> 00:28:34,070
Compared to all those benefits,

391
00:28:35,030 --> 00:28:38,160
those little side effects
are hardly worth mentioning.

392
00:28:39,790 --> 00:28:40,720
Is it that good?

393
00:28:42,110 --> 00:28:42,910
Come on, then.

394
00:28:43,590 --> 00:28:45,160
I'll beat you up.

395
00:28:45,550 --> 00:28:48,210
How about you eat this yourself
to numb the pain?

396
00:28:49,030 --> 00:28:51,630
Don't think I don't know
what you've been up to.

397
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:54,510
The Red Pills used to be just a drug,

398
00:28:54,510 --> 00:28:55,830
but not anymore.

399
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:59,930
You want to use me
to spread this strange disease.

400
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,590
I, Li Rongzhang,

401
00:29:02,830 --> 00:29:05,090
will never be part of your filthy scheme.

402
00:29:06,110 --> 00:29:07,270
And I will never

403
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:10,400
hand this batch of Red Pills over to you.

404
00:29:17,350 --> 00:29:18,310
Li Rongzhang.

405
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:24,210
Think carefully about the consequences.

406
00:29:29,510 --> 00:29:31,510
The North-South Railway is my turf.

407
00:29:31,750 --> 00:29:34,350
My Ying Army is
stationed at the train station.

408
00:29:34,350 --> 00:29:35,270
Even if I die,

409
00:29:35,270 --> 00:29:36,200
I guarantee you—

410
00:29:36,720 --> 00:29:38,720
not even a fly will get through.

411
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:41,240
You want the Red Pills?

412
00:29:43,310 --> 00:29:44,160
Dream on.

413
00:29:49,590 --> 00:29:50,440
Li Rongzhang.

414
00:29:51,350 --> 00:29:53,790
You're charged with abusing your authority

415
00:29:53,790 --> 00:29:54,880
to facilitate the distribution of drugs.

416
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:56,480
The evidence is conclusive.

417
00:29:56,510 --> 00:29:57,310
From this moment on,

418
00:29:57,310 --> 00:29:58,680
you're suspended from all official duties,

419
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:01,440
stripped of command
over the North-South Railway,

420
00:30:01,440 --> 00:30:02,590
and placed under house arrest,

421
00:30:02,590 --> 00:30:03,720
forbidden to leave!

422
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:08,400
Li Rongzhang,

423
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:10,680
defying military orders

424
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:12,620
is equivalent to treason.

425
00:30:28,350 --> 00:30:30,610
Go get the goods out of the train station.

426
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:32,790
Li Rongzhang's been arrested,

427
00:30:32,790 --> 00:30:33,720
but the station

428
00:30:34,110 --> 00:30:36,310
is still under the Ying Army's control.

429
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:39,550
Go to whoever will take over command
of the Ying Army.

430
00:30:39,550 --> 00:30:40,680
Get it done quickly.

431
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:56,530
Though I didn't know Miss Ren's full plan,

432
00:30:56,920 --> 00:30:57,920
at the wedding,

433
00:30:58,160 --> 00:31:00,160
I did swap identities with Miss Ren.

434
00:31:00,550 --> 00:31:02,160
Qingyu was aware of this too.

435
00:31:10,350 --> 00:31:11,150
Inspector Li.

436
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:14,510
There was another gunman at the scene,

437
00:31:14,510 --> 00:31:15,840
targeting the Marshal.

438
00:31:16,830 --> 00:31:17,920
Li Rongzhang,

439
00:31:18,400 --> 00:31:19,640
he deserves to die.

440
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:20,510
Ren Susu,

441
00:31:20,960 --> 00:31:22,960
my father had no grudge against you.

442
00:31:23,750 --> 00:31:25,880
In the plan your brother and I devised,

443
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:27,800
I was supposed to die anyway.

444
00:31:28,550 --> 00:31:29,270
Boze,

445
00:31:30,110 --> 00:31:31,200
if one day

446
00:31:31,790 --> 00:31:35,200
the Murong family and the Li family
ended up on opposite sides,

447
00:31:35,200 --> 00:31:36,240
what would you do?

448
00:31:39,070 --> 00:31:39,600
Brother,

449
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:40,920
you promised me.

450
00:31:41,510 --> 00:31:42,350
You said

451
00:31:43,110 --> 00:31:44,640
nothing would ever change.

452
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:45,960
Of course I remember.

453
00:31:46,350 --> 00:31:47,950
You'll always be my brother.

454
00:31:49,590 --> 00:31:50,510
Boze.

455
00:31:53,590 --> 00:31:55,990
The Murong family
will always be your home.

456
00:32:06,960 --> 00:32:07,920
You said

457
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:10,930
nothing would ever change.

458
00:32:14,440 --> 00:32:15,680
But it did.

459
00:32:20,350 --> 00:32:21,510
Even this early on,

460
00:32:23,480 --> 00:32:25,550
you already wanted to kill my father.

461
00:32:28,790 --> 00:32:29,920
Even this early on,

462
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:34,380
you already wanted to
destroy the Li family.

463
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:39,070
Brother.

464
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:53,640
But it was you...

465
00:32:56,510 --> 00:32:59,570
You were the one who sent me away
from the Murong family.

466
00:33:09,960 --> 00:33:11,240
If you could speak,

467
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:13,920
if you were still alive,

468
00:33:15,510 --> 00:33:16,790
could you tell me?

469
00:33:17,750 --> 00:33:18,440
Tell me,

470
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:20,200
was I ever truly family to you?

471
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:24,200
Did you ever truly see me as one?

472
00:33:26,590 --> 00:33:27,880
Or did you never,

473
00:33:29,440 --> 00:33:32,240
not even once,
treat me as your own brother—

474
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:35,350
always just

475
00:33:35,350 --> 00:33:37,590
an expendable pawn to you?

476
00:33:56,550 --> 00:33:57,480
Why,

477
00:33:57,720 --> 00:33:58,440
Brother?

478
00:34:00,590 --> 00:34:01,640
Why?

479
00:34:02,790 --> 00:34:03,480
Brother...

480
00:34:18,590 --> 00:34:19,320
Yes.

481
00:34:22,710 --> 00:34:23,969
I finally understand.

482
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:25,440
I was a fool.

483
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:27,280
Such a fool.

484
00:34:32,469 --> 00:34:35,130
The truth is,
you'd already given me the answer.

485
00:34:39,670 --> 00:34:40,929
From beginning to end,

486
00:34:42,190 --> 00:34:43,590
inside and out—

487
00:34:45,710 --> 00:34:48,510
I was never truly
one of the Murong family.

488
00:35:05,550 --> 00:35:07,150
You were a liar.

489
00:35:08,110 --> 00:35:09,110
It was you!

490
00:35:09,710 --> 00:35:12,030
Murong Qingyu, you deceived me!

491
00:35:26,030 --> 00:35:27,360
From this day forward,

492
00:35:28,230 --> 00:35:29,840
I sever all ties

493
00:35:30,190 --> 00:35:33,430
[Brother Boze]

494
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:31,690
with the Murong family!

495
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:37,330
If anyone tries to
destroy my Li family again...

496
00:35:41,670 --> 00:35:44,270
if anyone ever again
tries to harm my father...

497
00:35:48,190 --> 00:35:49,710
whoever it is...

498
00:35:52,710 --> 00:35:54,440
I will eliminate them,

499
00:35:55,670 --> 00:35:56,590
one

500
00:35:56,730 --> 00:36:00,560
[Brother Boze]

501
00:35:57,320 --> 00:35:58,920
by one!

502
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:05,030
I will never again
let anyone hurt my family—

503
00:36:07,190 --> 00:36:09,030
my real home!

504
00:36:14,490 --> 00:36:16,780
[Brother Boze]
